From 18d9ab15e5d4178627e29e83d06180c25502764c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:53:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(mcp): list every accepted field of a kind in
 list_operation_types

list_operation_types named only the fields that the default params
serialize. Optional fields (pocket tilt and rest, the plasma feed and
pierce keys, the Wire Contour extras) and the words of an enum field
were not listed.

A serde shape trace of ParamsDto (mcp/kind_fields/trace.rs) now drives
the DTO's own Deserialize and records the struct fields, the enum
variants and the Option fields of each kind. A field absent from the
defaults gets "optional": true, an enum field gets "values", and an
object or array field gets a short "shape" text. The two kinds that
flatten a struct (thread, sinker_side_burn) trace the flattened type by
itself. A kind that cannot be traced gets "fields_incomplete": true.

Fixes #3449

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
